WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Then lie down

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,600
Can't bear twice the gravity

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,000
How will you follow me to the mountains in the future?

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,100
night star

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,900
A useless thing ten times more dangerous than in the daytime

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,300
I originally expected you to wear a nose collar

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,700
I hope you're in danger

8
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,100
It seems I can only rely on myself

9
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,500
The jungle shrouded in night is too dark

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,100
It is very easy to be ambushed by unknown beasts when you go on an adventure.

11
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Since I can't go down

12
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,100
Then you can't come here in vain

13
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:28,420
It's getting hot

14
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,180
Jin Zang beats faster and faster

15
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,380
The energy in this moonlight

16
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,180
It actually got in through the pores.

17
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,500
My body is completely clear

18
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,820
Twice the gravity has no effect on me Tong Tianjin

19
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,820
This is exactly the special state of exertion recorded in the ancient monuments overnight.

20
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,020
My strength and ability to recover have all been greatly improved.

21
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,620
It’s not that I’m more talented than my ancestors

22
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:51,620
But this planet

23
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,220
This is the holy land of the Five Learning Forms
